# the dot is never applied to an aspect: only main is public (D-179, D-066)
** spec: semantics/aspects.md#what-an-aspect-is
primary aspect b52_dot_on_aspect is
  process main is
    apply worker.prepare();            ** compile error
  return;
end b52_dot_on_aspect;
